# `startofmonth` with an offset past the datetime range is DS4003.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project m = startofmonth(timestamp, 4000000)
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `startofmonth` does not fit in a `datetime`
  --> query:3:15
  |
3 | | project m = startofmonth(timestamp, 4000000)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: datetimes and timespans are counted in microseconds and hold about ±292,000 years
